    "body": "A [recent analysis](https://github.com/rustwasm/wasm-bindgen/issues/2983#issuecomment-1259294683) shows that the lack of a `[Throws]` extended attribute is the main blocker in rustwasm being able to automatically import WebIDL fragments from web specs at this stage.",
